  "description": "WESTAS crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group C 2/c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C59 H73 Er4 N13 O23,C1 H4 O1,H2 O1. From the CIF bond table, Er1 (Er) has 6 O neighbors; Er2 (Er) has 7 O neighbors; Er3 (Er) has 6 O neighbors; Er4 (Er) has 7 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 4 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.834-3.890 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 110.06-113.28°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Er4L4(CO3)(acac)2(H2O)2(CH3OH)(DMF)]·H2O·CH3OH. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 2 H2O (explicit grouped unit in article formula).",
